# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every line
# ending on checkout, and any edit re-commits the whole file as changed. This
# project is plain JavaScript and Markdown, so LF everywhere is the safe norm.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only launchers, should any ever be added here.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ico binary
